{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2024-06", "window": 4, "start_date": 1719100800, "end_date": 1719791999, "month_true_total": 101, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 22:00:10 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "168626644", "author": {"steamid": "76561198003899761", "personaname": "rod085", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/rod085/", "num_games_owned": 2151, "num_reviews": 60, "playtime_forever": 6305, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1098, "last_played": 1723635718, "avatar": "3d598067084fdf9cbf5d339d8049ba1c7fa7a795"}, "language": "english", "review": "Half the time the game won't launch or I have some other issue with the EA launcher.\n\nBut the game is good when it works. I recommend it if on sale.\n\nEDIT: Just discovered that this game can corrupt save files...", "timestamp_created": 1719772466, "timestamp_updated": 1720270738, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168562150", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010269539", "personaname": "Mischief", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Travesura/", "num_games_owned": 643, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 4068, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4068, "last_played": 1719724536, "avatar": "08b6fdb357cdb9132eb8056e14bb81c3b3c455f6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Honestly, I have mixed feelings about this one. It's not a horrible game, despite all its problems, we all know the ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ of its release, a lot of the problems from then are still in the game. \r\nA lot of bugs out there, a boring main story and too many forgettable characters. Bright moments here and there, but overall pretty lame. \r\n\r\nProbably playing it right after finishing the original trilogy didn't help at all. \r\nIt feels like a missed opportunity to me, and it's sad, I love Mass Effect and while this game isn't as bad as I thought it would be, it's still pretty disappointing. Even more so knowing how poorly it was received, the whole \"Andromeda saga\" was grounded. We may never see the next chapters of Ryder's story. \r\n\r\nPersonally I don't recommend the game, however, it's not all bad and if you want a 6 or even 7 out of 10 sci-fi experience, this is it. Don't expect too much, it entertains that's all. \r\n\r\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3278490450", "timestamp_created": 1719726994, "timestamp_updated": 1719726994, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 29, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.702560305595397949", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168538903", "author": {"steamid": "76561198164510583", "personaname": "Sevatar", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TheMalkavian/", "num_games_owned": 331, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 6054, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6054, "last_played": 1719762212, "avatar": "0224f7fab4bbb53001d7f5f276b52de7fd704b6a"}, "language": "english", "review": "It was a decent experience actually, It wasn't bad. \nThere were parts of the game I outright skipped like any major exploration,\nI somewhat liked the new villain for what it's worth. And the new crew wasn't actually bad, I very much liked interacting with them. \nI would gladly see the Quarian Ark plot unfold.", "timestamp_created": 1719701830, "timestamp_updated": 1731503725, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.506578981